{"id":"c9600914c1ce2faa","group":"20","path":"20/20-cor-dynamic-flow.md","title":"动态流定理的补集覆盖形式","display":"cor-dynamic-flow — 动态流定理的补集覆盖形式","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-cor-dynamic-flow","aliases":["20-cor-dynamic-flow"],"display":"cor-dynamic-flow — 动态流定理的补集覆盖形式","chapter":"2","section":"2.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 2.6.5","source_printed_pages":[48],"source_pdf_pages":[84],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-dynamic-flow-noncomputable]]","[[20-thm-rec-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-cor-dynamic-flow"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-cor-dynamic-flow</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-dynamic-flow — 动态流定理的补集覆盖形式"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.6.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>48</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>84</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e8aedee3e7e32f49\" href=\"?note=e8aedee3e7e32f49\" title=\"20-thm-dynamic-flow-noncomputable\">20-thm-dynamic-flow-noncomputable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"550ce05cba351a42\" href=\"?note=550ce05cba351a42\" title=\"20-thm-rec-re\">20-thm-rec-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Clock}(a,V)\">\\(\\operatorname{Clock}(a,V)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=V_j\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R\">\\(B=V_j\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\setminus B\\subseteq V_e\">\\(\\omega\\setminus B\\subseteq V_e\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e8aedee3e7e32f49\" href=\"?note=e8aedee3e7e32f49\" title=\"20-thm-dynamic-flow-noncomputable\">20-thm-dynamic-flow-noncomputable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"550ce05cba351a42\" href=\"?note=550ce05cba351a42\" title=\"20-thm-rec-re\">20-thm-rec-re</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}dynamic\\text{-}flow}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Flow}(a;e,j)\\notin\\mathcal R\\land|\\operatorname{Flow}(a;e,j)|=\\omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}dynamic\\text{-}flow}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Flow}(a;e,j)\\notin\\mathcal R\\land|\\operatorname{Flow}(a;e,j)|=\\omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>假设给 V_e\\B= B̄。B̄ 若 c.e.，互补定理会使 B 可计算，矛盾。应用前一动态流定理。原书这里的假设是覆盖 B 的补集，PDF 提取文字会丢失上横线；已按页面图像核对。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 2.6.5；印刷页 48；PDF 第 84 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-dynamic-flow-noncomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e8aedee3e7e32f49","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-dynamic-flow-noncomputable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-rec-re","status":"resolved","id":"550ce05cba351a42","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-rec-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-dynamic-flow-noncomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e8aedee3e7e32f49","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-dynamic-flow-noncomputable]]；see [[20-thm-rec-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-rec-re","status":"resolved","id":"550ce05cba351a42","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-dynamic-flow-noncomputable]]；see [[20-thm-rec-re]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Clock}(a,V)","display":false},{"tex":"B=V_j\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\setminus B\\subseteq V_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}dynamic\\text{-}flow}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Flow}(a;e,j)\\notin\\mathcal R\\land|\\operatorname{Flow}(a;e,j)|=\\omega.","display":true}],"bytes":1245,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["e8aedee3e7e32f49","550ce05cba351a42"]}